      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated vets and empathetic clinical care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners express deep appreciation for the veterinary surgeons and clinical nurses at the Shamrock Street PDSA Pet Hospital. Reviewers commend practitioners like Erin, Antonio, and Emma for their kindness, patience, and empathetic bedside manner during difficult moments. While the overwhelming majority praise the clinical team, several clients experienced dismissive communication from front-desk staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate treatment for suffering pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients emphasize the deep compassion shown towards cats and dogs, particularly during emergency treatments and end-of-life care. Reviewers report that veterinary staff take time to build trust with frightened pets, handle animals gently, and strive to relieve pain without rushing. Many owners credit the hospital team with saving their companions after serious accidents and chronic illnesses."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Thorough clinical explanations alongside reception delays"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners appreciate veterinarians who explain diagnoses, treatment choices, and repeat prescriptions clearly and thoroughly. However, communication regarding registration policies, appointment waiting times, and front-desk interactions receives mixed feedback. While clinicians offer reassurance during visits, some clients found phone lines difficult to navigate during periods of high demand."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Who is eligible for pet treatment at PDSA Pet Hospital?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The charity hospital provides free and low-cost veterinary treatment to pet owners living within catchment areas who receive qualifying means-tested benefits."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is parking available near the Shamrock Street hospital?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "On-street parking with council meters is situated outside the hospital, though clients note spaces fill up quickly during peak hours."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the hospital require appointments for visits?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients are advised to phone ahead to schedule appointment times or arrange urgent emergency triage."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    }
